WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 13.9 · Strategy to Action: Plan, Deliver & Review
Annual review, strategy refresh and health check

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Each year, check your results and repeat the health check against your baseline.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Same areas, same scale, evidence for every change.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Separate “written down” from “actually practised”.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Turn findings into changes to objectives and plans.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: finance went from not started to practised; partnerships only documented. Survival target lowered openly to 60% for new sites.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your repeated health check and next year’s changes.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
